</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span class="cm-keyword">def</span> <span class="cm-def">master_decrypt</span>(<span class="cm-variable">input_file</span>, <span class="cm-variable">output_file</span>):</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="cm-keyword">with</span> <span class="cm-builtin">open</span>(<span class="cm-variable">input_file</span>, <span class="cm-string">"rb"</span>) <span class="cm-keyword">as</span> <span class="cm-variable">f</span>:</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="cm-variable">ciphertext</span> <span class="cm-operator">=</span> <span class="cm-variable">f</span>.<span class="cm-property">read</span>()</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span cm-text="" cm-zwsp="">
