</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="cm-comment"># Case A: AES -&gt; Rolling XOR -&gt; Slky</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="cm-comment"># Case B: AES -&gt; Slky (No Rolling)</span></span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="cm-keyword">for</span> <span class="cm-variable">mode</span> <span class="cm-keyword">in</span> [<span class="cm-string">'rolling'</span>, <span class="cm-string">'no_rolling'</span>]:</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="cm-variable">current_data</span> <span class="cm-operator">=</span> <span class="cm-builtin">bytearray</span>(<span class="cm-variable">raw_aes</span>)</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="cm-keyword">if</span> <span class="cm-variable">mode</span> <span class="cm-operator">==</span> <span class="cm-string">'rolling'</span>:</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="cm-keyword">for</span> <span class="cm-variable">i</span> <span class="cm-keyword">in</span> <span class="cm-builtin">range</span>(<span class="cm-builtin">len</span>(<span class="cm-variable">current_data</span>)):</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="present