st 1 open and 1 closed port</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;">Aggressive OS guesses: Huawei MT880 ADSL modem (97%), Juniper Networks SSG 20 firewall (97%), Juniper SRX200-series firewall (JUNOS 12.1 - 12.3) (97%), SiliconDust HDHomeRun set top box (97%), Cisco SG200 switch (97%), Cisco SG300 switch (97%), CMI Genus NEMA terminal (97%), Dell Remote Access Controller 4/I (97%), GlobespanVirata GS8100, Huawei MT880, or Solwise SAR 100 ADSL modem (97%), HP Integrated Lights-Out 2 (97%)</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;">No exact OS matches for host (test conditions non-ideal).</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;">Network Distance: 3 hops</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;">TCP Sequence Prediction: Difficulty=257 (Good luck!)</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;">IP ID Sequence Generation: Busy server or unknown class</span></pre><pre class=" CodeMirror-line " role="presentation"><span role="presentation" style="padding-right: 0.1px;"><span cm-text="" cm-zwsp="">
